# Optional: copy to .env.release (gitignored). `make release` reads it.
# Signing and notarisation credentials live in the keychain; see
# `make notary-setup`. Everything here has a working default.

# The certificate codesign uses. Default: the first "Developer ID
# Application" identity in the keychain.
# MACOS_SIGN_IDENTITY="Developer ID Application: Your Name (TEAMID)"

# The notarytool keychain profile. Default: ampworth-notary, created by
# `make notary-setup`.
# MACOS_NOTARY_PROFILE=ampworth-notary

# Default: `gh auth token`, and the tap token defaults to it.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=
# HOMEBREW_TAP_GITHUB_TOKEN=
